WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Create a complete starter map.
The wizard generates the scene and starter assets.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.467
Set the save slot and validate.
Validation catches setup errors early.

00:00:13.467 --> 00:00:38.067
Save the authored scene.
The scene becomes the editable handoff.

00:00:38.067 --> 00:01:15.500
Reopen the saved scene.
This confirms the authoring result persists.

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:49.033
Open Map Studio.
The editor exposes the map controls.

00:01:49.033 --> 00:02:09.033
Search for Starter Blueprint.
The picker connects the demo to its source asset.

00:02:09.033 --> 00:02:13.480
Set seed 4242 and regenerate.
A fixed seed makes the result repeatable.

00:02:13.480 --> 00:02:28.713
Select Starter Theme.
The theme applies the demo look consistently.

00:02:28.713 --> 00:02:38.380
Adjust the preview zoom, then pan the graph.
The overview checks the generated layout.

00:02:38.380 --> 00:02:43.813
Apply the blueprint and save.
This records the authored map for reuse.
